### Coterie — no session at all

### Functions refuse an unauthenticated execution
POST {{endpoint}}/functions/rollPool/executions
X-Appwrite-Project: {{project}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "async": false, "body": "{\"characterId\":\"{{playerCharacterId}}\",\"traits\":[\"dexterity\"]}" }

> {%
  client.test("guests cannot execute", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 401, `expected 401, got ${response.status}`);
  });
%}

### Rows are invisible to guests
GET {{endpoint}}/tablesdb/{{db}}/tables/rolls/rows/{{tableRollId}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{project}}

> {%
  client.test("guests cannot read the feed", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 404 || response.status === 401, `expected 404/401, got ${response.status}`);
  });
%}

### The blank sheet is for signed-in players only
GET {{endpoint}}/storage/buckets/sheet-templates/files/v20-sheet/view
X-Appwrite-Project: {{project}}

> {%
  client.test("guests cannot download the sheet template", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 404 || response.status === 401, `expected 404/401, got ${response.status}`);
  });
%}
